WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:05.220
staff and volunteers at a wildlife&nbsp;
sanctuary in Thailand helped save a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:05.220 --> 00:00:10.440
baby elephant that fell into a drainage pond&nbsp;
at a nearby Golf Course the mother elephant&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:10.440 --> 00:00:15.180
watched as Rescuers used a backhoe to&nbsp;
dig a path for the animal to get out&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:17.160 --> 00:00:21.900
officials say the mother and baby were reunited&nbsp;
and returned to their herd in the forest

